{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ebc0681aba0211eefef91186f36befcf0dc75c9d1d25efe8ab1d2be857af7",
      "text": "始动，“男极ッ！偶像联盟”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e209373db03f1e96260245737effd2ee414a2bdcc9658258869067443c685a1a",
      "text": "在事务所举办的JIF庆功会结束，\n制作人与实、诚司、道夫、\n次郎、雨彦一同前往二次聚会。\n次日，送到参加二次聚会的成员手中的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ebc0681aba0211eefef91186f36befcf0dc75c9d1d25efe8ab1d2be857af7",
      "text": "始动，“男极ッ！偶像联盟”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a9f2e8da0a2b1741cae0c73c9a7877d3eada144074338dd35ac2b289672c27",
      "text": "JAPAN IDOL FES数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:923a338fc33696d70e084b02ec05ab501cf5c74c27bf2f12a87856d4ff0808e6",
      "text": "各位，庆功会辛苦了！\n明天的休息日请大家好好休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3cef16830cb5dcdba1acd6b5f84d4cb119e6bd74489a60115a523cff398cd7",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n我把垃圾集中收在这一边了。还有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac49aa6dcd9c8ca4fe157fd028c658cb3fece270c0c5389ae0947cad327bdad",
      "text": "贤君，你和大家一起回去也没关系的哦。\n收拾善后的事情交给我就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:facebcce3baffe3908b79bb0f745eb2a711e48b530cc226f4b128beddaf597d5",
      "text": "不，我也来帮忙吧。\n我还有使不完的精力呢，就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd4cb2bc5f14e0c25112f3dbbd1c06b8328235b126927c44337a9eca98fafae",
      "text": "（……毕竟JIF盛况空前呢。\n偶像们在整个庆功宴上也一直很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364d9a3614b8aed82d6e7dc4957f31b8a254a955602bb95773da588462c34653",
      "text": "（所以，才会送来“那封信”吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000069:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "几个小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a33806006e0599272e7af805c5a5819187ede932e801297288dcdf36faca5d56",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，JIF辛苦了。\n那是充满激情的最棒舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e985c53d304761027a89fef6e69ac21d18431a695e87453f82ddf6048e124ac",
      "text": "非常感谢！这份成功，\n完全归功于各位偶像的努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:160061c3d2d3ebf53def69b803e9f51123493a33154992bcf65eeb3570cabf38",
      "text": "唔！今后我也十分期待你与偶像们的活跃！\n……话说回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216d7b76bf2774ed8ddcb6c108db6c6c21ceaee933fc4d4f3e82f5889f07b256",
      "text": "听说收到了一封奇妙的信件，\n这是真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb7835d5cead77580cdc6b4624b7c33e802297749c81019f18c01f0d0c103e1",
      "text": "是的。JIF结束后，\nJupiter的三人在休息室里发现了这么个东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
